<title>USA: Firstar Corp Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Firstar Corp Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.93		    $0.88</p>
<p> Net			 69,272		   67,077</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  74,708		   75,887</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 includes charge of $0.06 a share for recapitalization of the Savings Association Insurance Fund.  </p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.39		    $2.05</p>
<p> Net			176,553		  157,144</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  73,642		   76,085</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine months 1996 includes SAIF charge and restructuring charge of $0.41 a share. Nine months 1995 includes $0.36 a share in charges for acquisitions.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
